---
import Navbar from "../../../../components/Navbar.astro";
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>官方软件 — Linxira OS</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/assets/favicon.svg">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: 'Noto Sans', system-ui, sans-serif; background: #0E1417; color: #e5e7eb; line-height: 1.8; }

    .layout { display: flex; padding-top: 60px; min-height: 100vh; }
    .sidebar { width: 260px; background: #0c1322; border-right: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.3); padding: 2rem 0; position: fixed; top: 60px; bottom: 0; overflow-y: auto; }
    .sidebar-title { color: #64748b; font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; padding: 0 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .sidebar a { display: block; padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem; color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; transition: all 0.2s; border-left: 3px solid transparent; }
    .sidebar a:hover { color: #20B8B0; background: rgba(32,184,176,0.05); }
    .sidebar a.active { color: #20B8B0; border-left-color: #20B8B0; background: rgba(32,184,176,0.08); }
    .sidebar .section { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }

    .main { flex: 1; margin-left: 260px; padding: 3rem 4rem; max-width: 1000px; }
    h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #20B8B0, #F36F5D); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; }
    h2 { font-size: 1.4rem; color: #e2e8f0; margin: 2.5rem 0 0.8rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.3); }
    p { color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    a { color: #20B8B0; }
    code { background: rgba(30,41,59,0.8); padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #20B8B0; }

    .app-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 2.5rem; }
    .app-card { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30,41,59,0.6), rgba(14,20,23,0.8)); border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.5); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.3rem 1.4rem; transition: border-color 0.3s, transform 0.2s; }
    .app-card:hover { border-color: rgba(32,184,176,0.4); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .app-card h3 { color: #20B8B0; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
    .app-card .pkg { color: #64748b; font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: monospace; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .app-card p { font-size: 0.88rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
    .app-card .tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.7rem; background: rgba(32,184,176,0.15); color: #20B8B0; padding: 0.1rem 0.5rem; border-radius: 4px; margin: 0.15rem 0.2rem 0 0; }
    .app-card .cli { display: block; font-size: 0.75rem; color: #67e8f9; background: #111827; border-left: 2px solid #20B8B0; padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; border-radius: 3px; }
    footer { text-align: center; padding: 3rem 2rem; color: #475569; font-size: 0.85rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.3); margin-left: 260px; }
    @media (max-width: 768px) { .sidebar { display: none; } .main { margin-left: 0; padding: 2rem; } footer { margin-left: 0; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <Navbar lang="zh" active="docs" />

  <div class="layout">
    <aside class="sidebar">
      <div class="section">
        <div class="sidebar-title">开始</div>
        <a href="/zh/docs/">概述</a>
        <a href="/zh/docs/install/">安装指南</a>
        <a href="/zh/docs/quick-start/">快速开始</a>
      </div>
      <div class="section">
        <div class="sidebar-title">用户指南</div>
        <a href="/zh/docs/package-managers/">包管理器</a>
        <a href="/zh/docs/ecosystem/">软件生态</a>
        <a href="/zh/docs/apps/" class="active">官方软件</a>
        <a href="/zh/docs/drivers/">驱动配置</a>
        <a href="/zh/docs/config-hub/">配置中心</a>
        <a href="/zh/docs/remote-access/">远程访问（SSH）</a>
        <a href="/zh/docs/desktop/">桌面环境</a>
      </div>
      <div class="section">
        <div class="sidebar-title">开发者</div>
        <a href="/zh/docs/contributing/">参与贡献</a>
        <a href="/zh/docs/building/">构建 ISO</a>
        <a href="/zh/docs/repository-structure/">仓库结构</a>
      </div>
      <div class="section">
        <div class="sidebar-title">参考</div>
        <a href="/zh/legal/license/">开源协议</a>
        <a href="/zh/docs/glossary/">术语表</a>
        <a href="/zh/docs/faq/">常见问题</a>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <main class="main">
      <a href="/zh/docs/" style="color:#20B8B0; text-decoration:none; display:inline-block; margin-bottom:1.5rem;">← 返回文档</a>
      <h1>Linxira 官方软件</h1>
      <p>Linxira OS 自带一套自研工具链，围绕「<strong>经过审核的 catalog 元数据 + 确定性事务后端 + 只读/规划式安全模型</strong>」构建：GUI 只负责展示与规划，真正的系统修改由受控后端执行。所有软件包托管在 Linxira 官方签名仓库 <a href="https://linxira-os.github.io/linxira-packages/x86_64" target="_blank">[linxira]</a>，通过 <code>pacman</code> 安装。</p>

      <h2>日常工具</h2>
      <div class="app-grid">
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Linxira Welcome</h3>
          <div class="pkg">linxira-welcome</div>
          <p>Plasma 原生状态与路由中心：Home / Status / Help 三页，开机自动打开。只读展示 catalog 与安装 receipt，固定工具启动器。</p>
          <span class="tag">GUI</span><span class="tag">自动启动</span>
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Config Hub</h3>
          <div class="pkg">linxira-config-hub</div>
          <p>管理员命令行：SSH 服务与密钥管理、镜像源（Arch/npm/PyPI/AUR/Go/Flatpak）、网络诊断、安全状态、catalog 只读查询。</p>
          <span class="tag">CLI</span>
          <code class="cli">linxira-config ssh status</code>
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Shelly</h3>
          <div class="pkg">shelly</div>
          <p>安装后的通用图形化软件包管理器（CLI + GTK 界面 + 更新通知），替代手动 pacman 操作。</p>
          <span class="tag">GUI</span><span class="tag">CLI</span>
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Linxira Update</h3>
          <div class="pkg">linxira-update</div>
          <p>系统更新通知与维护助手：交互式更新提示、系统托盘小程序、更新前后自定义任务。由 systemd 用户服务驱动。</p>
          <span class="tag">托盘</span><span class="tag">自动检查</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>软件安装与运行时</h2>
      <div class="app-grid">
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Package Center</h3>
          <div class="pkg">linxira-package-center</div>
          <p>精选应用安装工具（Quick System Software Setup）：catalog v3 应用分类树、plan/confirm/apply 三步事务。通用软件中心由 Shelly 负责。</p>
          <span class="tag">GUI</span>
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Component Manager</h3>
          <div class="pkg">linxira-component-manager</div>
          <p>能力包 / 运行时 / 工具链选择（Quick System Runtime Setup）：组件三态树（required/recommended/optional），仅安装、不支持卸载。</p>
          <span class="tag">GUI</span>
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Components</h3>
          <div class="pkg">linxira-components</div>
          <p>目录绑定的 pacman 事务规划与 receipt 后端：确定性 plan、SHA-256 规范 JSON 摘要、root-only pacman、持久 receipt。D-Bus 服务 <code>org.linxira.Components1</code>。</p>
          <span class="tag">后端</span><span class="tag">systemd</span>
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Catalog</h3>
          <div class="pkg">linxira-catalog</div>
          <p>经审核的软件组件元数据目录：desktops / applications / components / bundles / operations / categories 六面模型，稳定 ID，bundles 组成 DAG。</p>
          <span class="tag">数据</span><span class="tag">schema</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>硬件与系统管理</h2>
      <div class="app-grid">
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Hardware Driver Manager</h3>
          <div class="pkg">linxira-hardware-driver-manager</div>
          <p>硬件/驱动报告与固定策略规划 UI：消费 chwd-detector 输出、NVIDIA open/proprietary 策略、root 只读诊断；驱动 Apply 仅限 Hyper-V/QEMU/VMware。</p>
          <span class="tag">GUI</span>
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Kernel Manager</h3>
          <div class="pkg">linxira-kernel-manager</div>
          <p>内核/启动/initramfs 只读报告与固定策略规划：仅支持 linux/linux-lts 矩阵、GRUB 报告；Apply 恒为 backend-not-ready。</p>
          <span class="tag">GUI</span><span class="tag">CLI</span>
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>HWD Detector（lhwd）</h3>
          <div class="pkg">linxira-hwd-detector</div>
          <p>硬件检测与驱动配置工具（Rust，完整 CHWD 移植）：无参输出只读 JSON 检测报告；<code>lhwd</code> 命令提供 list / autoconfigure / install / remove 完整 CLI。详见<a href="/zh/docs/drivers/">驱动配置</a>。</p>
          <code class="cli">lhwd --list · lhwd -a</code>
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Gaming Manager</h3>
          <div class="pkg">linxira-gaming-manager</div>
          <p>用户级游戏库与兼容性工作区：Steam 库发现、导入非 Steam .exe、固定 UMU/Wine runner、restic 备份、catalog 绑定。</p>
          <span class="tag">GUI</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>恢复与诊断</h2>
      <div class="app-grid">
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Recovery Diagnostics</h3>
          <div class="pkg">linxira-recovery-diagnostics</div>
          <p>只读恢复诊断与修复规划：pacman-lock 诊断、live-chroot 就绪检查；快照/回滚/修复操作当前均为 apply-backend-not-ready。</p>
          <span class="tag">GUI</span>
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Completion Agent</h3>
          <div class="pkg">linxira-completion-agent</div>
          <p>首次联网完成流程：绑定 installer receipt、展示延后安装项。拒绝错误交接，AUR/Flatpak 一律延后，仅展示 reviewed 项。</p>
          <span class="tag">GUI</span><span class="tag">自动启动</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>系统组件</h2>
      <div class="app-grid">
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Artwork</h3>
          <div class="pkg">linxira-artwork</div>
          <p>官方美术资源：Logo、壁纸、图标、Plymouth 启动动画、欢迎横幅。品牌色规范与 SVG 源文件。</p>
          <span class="tag">资源</span>
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Hooks</h3>
          <div class="pkg">linxira-hooks</div>
          <p>系统识别的 pacman hooks：os-release / lsb-release / reboot-required / plymouth-initramfs 与配套脚本。</p>
          <span class="tag">pacman</span>
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Keyring</h3>
          <div class="pkg">linxira-keyring</div>
          <p>Linxira 包签名公钥环：<code>/usr/share/keyrings/linxira.gpg</code>，安装时自动 pacman-key 添加并本地信任。</p>
          <span class="tag">签名</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>设计原则</h2>
      <ul style="color:#94a3b8; margin:0.5rem 0 1rem 1.5rem;">
        <li><strong>只读优先</strong>：检测器与诊断只读，修改一律走受控后端。</li>
        <li><strong>目录绑定</strong>：GUI 只从 catalog 读取稳定 ID，绝不接受任意参数/命令/路径。</li>
        <li><strong>规划式事务</strong>：plan → confirm → apply，receipt 持久记录结果。</li>
        <li><strong>签名仓库</strong>：所有官方包经 GPG 签名，安装时校验。</li>
      </ul>
    </main>
  </div>

  <footer><p>Linxira OS 直接基于 Arch Linux 构建，是与 Arch Linux 无隶属关系且未经其官方认可的独立项目。</p></footer>
</body>
</html>
